OL,3,CO'Connor 'over the moon' after gold
OL,4,Cmedal win for NI
OL,6,FKate O'Connor has secured Northern
OL,7,FIreland's first gold medal of the
OL,8,FCommonwealth Games in Glasgow.
OL,10,FShe delivered NI's first athletics
OL,11,Fgold since 1986 and has become the
OL,12,Fgames' first new heptathlon champion
OL,13,Fsince 2018.
OL,15,FO'Connor finished with 6,569 points,
OL,16,Fcoming out ahead of England's Jade
OL,17,FO'Dowda (silver) and Australia's Tori
OL,18,FWest (bronze).
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
