PN,41602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1785586720
OL,3,CO'Connor 'over the moon' after gold
OL,4,Cmedal win for NI
OL,6,FAfter a win in the long jump and
OL,7,Fseason's best 52.85m javelin throw in
OL,8,Fthe morning session, she swept all
OL,9,Fthree of Thursday's events by winning
OL,10,Fthe 800m finale.
OL,12,FSpeaking to UTV, O'Connor said: "I'm
OL,13,Fover the moon. I think that it's maybe
OL,14,Ffinally starting to settle in that
OL,15,FI've got it. I was a little bit
OL,16,Foverwhelmed there for a couple of
OL,17,Fminutes, but I'm absolutely buzzing
OL,18,Fwith the outcome."
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,417,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1785586720
OL,3,CO'Connor 'over the moon' after gold
OL,4,Cmedal win for NI
OL,6,FShe explained her tactical approach to
OL,7,Fthe 800m finale: "I suppose the plan
OL,8,Fwas to let the girls go out.
OL,10,F"I knew that they were tussling for
OL,11,Fthe bronze medal, but I had kind of
OL,12,Fput a side note to my coaches where I
OL,13,Fwas like, if I feel like the option is
OL,14,Fthere to win it, I'm definitely going
OL,15,Fto try to do that.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,417,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1785586720
OL,3,CO'Connor 'over the moon' after gold
OL,4,Cmedal win for NI
OL,6,F"And with 60 or 70 meters to go, I
OL,7,Ffelt like I was in striking distance,
OL,8,Fand I thought that I'd put on a show
OL,9,Ffor everybody and win the event, and
OL,10,Fthen obviously the event overall at
OL,11,Fthe same time."
OL,13,FDespite challenging weather and a
OL,14,Ftough start, O'Connor turned the
OL,15,Fperformance around: "The rain was
OL,16,Fdefinitely not something that I
OL,17,Fenjoyed competing in, and the shot put
OL,18,Fwas pretty catastrophic.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,417,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1785586720
OL,3,CO'Connor 'over the moon' after gold
OL,4,Cmedal win for NI
OL,6,F"I think that I showed that I'm a
OL,7,Ffighter, and I came back, and I worked
OL,8,Freally hard today. I enjoyed every
OL,9,Fsecond of it. I love competing when
OL,10,Fthe sun's out.
OL,12,F"The girls that I'm competing
OL,13,Falongside are great as well, and the
OL,14,Fcrowd were fab. I just enjoyed the
OL,15,Fwhole competition."
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,417,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1785586720
OL,3,CO'Connor 'over the moon' after gold
OL,4,Cmedal win for NI
OL,6,FReflecting on bringing home Team NI's
OL,7,Fopening gold, she added: "It's an
OL,8,Fhonour to put the vest on, and to
OL,9,Fcompete like that and win a gold medal
OL,10,Fand bring the gold back to Northern
OL,11,FIreland is amazing."
OL,13,FLooking ahead to the European
OL,14,FChampionships in two weeks, O'Connor
OL,15,Fviews the victory as key preparation:
OL,16,F"I've actually got Europeans in two
OL,17,Fweeks as well, so the plan was to come
OL,18,Fover here and shake off the rust, and
OL,19,Fwin the gold medal, and I'll come away
OL,20,Fand I know a few areas where I need to
OL,21,Fwork on and kind of tighten up for.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,417,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1785586720
OL,3,CO'Connor 'over the moon' after gold
OL,4,Cmedal win for NI
OL,6,F"For the next comp and I'll definitely
OL,7,Fdo that. I competed really well here
OL,8,Ftoday, and I had to keep reminding
OL,9,Fmyself that this is a championship.
OL,10,FSometimes it's not all about scores;
OL,11,Fit's about competing. I think I
OL,12,Fcompeted really well."
OL,14,FBefore resuming training, she plans to
OL,15,Fcelebrate her milestone win: "I have
OL,16,Fso many cousins and everything here,
OL,17,Fso I'm really looking forward to
OL,18,Fseeing all of them. Then probably just
OL,19,Fchill out and get ready for the next
OL,20,Fcomp."
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G7/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
